OL,3,GNEWSAFree fruit scheme for pupils axed
OL,4,Adue to wastage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pilot scheme offering free fruit to
OL,7,Fchildren will not be expanded because
OL,8,Fit is not popular enough, according to
OL,9,Fa Jersey minister.
OL,11,FSince 2024 children in four primary
OL,12,Fschools have been able to get apples,
OL,13,Fbananas and other fruit.
OL,15,FHowever, Minister for Education and
OL,16,FLifelong Learning Catherine Curtis said
OL,17,Fthere had only been a "modest increase"
OL,18,Fin children eating fruit since the
OL,19,Fstart of the scheme.
