OL,3,GNEWSAFree fruit scheme for pupils axed
OL,4,Adue to wastage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government announced in September
OL,7,Ffresh fruit would be included in a
OL,8,Fschool food programme which provides
OL,9,Fhot school meals for government primary
OL,10,Fschools.
